<title>SWEDEN: ABB investment management unit in HK link.</title>
<headline>ABB investment management unit in HK link.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>International engineering group ABB AG on Monday said its investment management unit was in a strategic alliance with Hong Kong's Lloyd George Management.</p>
</text>
